--TEST--
the string converted with `as class<T>` is compared with a class's whole name, and the namespace it is written in is not applied, so a short name answers nothing — `rule:types/class-reference`
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespace App;

interface Model { }
class User implements Model { }

$class = 'Us<|>er' as class<Model>;
--REQUEST--
definition
--EXPECT--
none
